    "reading_time_min": 2,
    "language": "en",
    "featured": false,
    "content": "---\nid: \"lai-haraoba-wakonlo-laoba\"\ntitle: \"LAI HARAOBA WAKONLO LAOBA\"\nsummary: \"Sanamahee Laining Leechat Kangleipak\"\ndate: \"2026-11-03\"\nauthor: \"Yumnam Tamphachao Meetei\"\ncategory: \"Philosophy\"\nthumbnail: \"images/ceremony-photo-200kb.jpg\"\nlanguage: \"en\"\nfeatured: false\n---\n\n![ceremony-photo-200kb](images/ceremony-photo-200kb.jpg)\n\n\n*****LAI HARAOBA GI WANGULOL\n\n> Lai Haraoba gi Wakonlo Laoba Asige Nunge Oiba Wangulon \n\n\nChingda gi wakon na tamda tage mahaiba Tam gi wakon na chingda tage mahaiba  Wakon na fase Lifase Wakon Tanoi Noi\nEshei asina taklibadi meeoibagi  kok haiba asi wakhal lousing  peifamni wakon ni. \n\nAduda meoibagi khoidou makha khudon ani hanthaba lai gi famphal oiriba khoidou thambal hairiba asi su pukning haiba wakhal aduge wakon ni aduga wakhal gi tungnafan kok ni. \nPukningi tungnafam khoidou thambal ni kok na Ching , ni Khoidou thambal na Tam ni , Wakhal na ching gi wakok kou e. Pukning na tam gi wakon kou e . \n\nMeeoibagi apam nungsi kouba pukninge moithemna sumhattuna lepfuda wakhal meira oina leiriba tampha (Fambi) na lemfudagi kumtharaktuna khoidou thambal da tunglababu ching dagi wakok na tamda tage mahaiba haina hairi . \n\nAduga awangba wakhal na pukningbu khudum chandana apam nungsi khunhei tharabada khoidou thambal da tungliba tamphana lepfuda karakpabu tamda gi Wakok na Chingda tage mahaiba haina hairi. amana pukning khudum chanduna apam nungsi khunhei tharaga tampha bu peisinduna thamnabadi meeoiba gi wakhal lousing nganthoklakli noithoklak e\nChaothoklak e haibani \n\n>Wakon na fase Lifase, Wakon tanoi noi\nHaina hairi Haibadi wakhal gi tungnafam na meeoiba gi lemfuni pukninge tungnafam na khoidou thambal ni . \n\nLemfu bu ching kouwe. \nKhoidou thambal bu Tam kouwe Wakhal na ching gi wakon ni, Pukning na tam gi wakon ni . \nChing amdi tam animak ki wakon oiribada - Hak chang gi tungnafam ni  Amasung oiba wakon asibu apam nungsi kouba pukning na \nSumthaduna tamphana lepfuda gi kumtharaktuna khoidou thambal da tunglei aduga wakhal na pukningbu khudum chanduna apam nungsi kumkei thabaga khoidou thambal dagi tampha na kakhiduna lemfuda tunglui. \n\nAsumna hakchang gi apambabu pukning na amuk kouba, wakhal na amuk pukhat tou e masi pukning ga wakhal ga liching manadabagi ni \nAduga meeoiba gi wakhal na pukningbu chetna khudum chansinduna thamnabadi pukning su wakhal da tinsinkhi  asumna pukning wakhal ani tinsinnaba tampha bu yoktuna thamlabadi meeoiba gi wakhal asi nganthoirak e amdi noithok chaothoklak e haibani.\n"
